# Certificate chain material for suameca.banrep.gov.co.
#
# Banrep's server does not send the intermediate certificate that links
# its leaf certificate to a trusted root, so strict TLS clients (curl,
# httr2) cannot build a complete chain and refuse the connection.
# These two public certificates supply the missing link, letting
# verification succeed WITHOUT disabling it.
#
# 1. Intermediate: GeoTrust EV RSA CA G2 (DigiCert Inc)
#    Source: http://cacerts.digicert.com/GeoTrustEVRSACAG2.crt
#    (the AIA 'CA Issuers' URI inside Banrep's own leaf certificate)
# 2. Root: DigiCert Global Root G2 - a widely trusted public root,
#    present in the current Mozilla CA bundle.

